{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every. Single. Species.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some help each other. Others give in to their natural instincts. <br>With more than 400 cards to discover, experiment with countless combinations and shape your own path!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ecosystem Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards interact with each other on an expanding hexagonal grid. <br>Each card has a unique effect that influences the animals and plants around it on the board. <br>Inspired by nature, the possibilities are endless. Unleash your creativity and trigger insane combos in a single turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule Wild City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your campaign, rally supporters, and outvote your rivals to become the Mayor of Wild City. <br>As you progress through your electoral campaign, you will face Protests and Boss Fights that shake up the rules, forcing you to quickly adapt to new obstacles and debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploit and Escalate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more synergies you'll discover.<br>Thanks to a keyword-based system, a single card can be used in many different ways as each building block interconnects.<br>As every piece of your build comes together, you will reach heights you did not think were possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique strategic roguelike deckbuilding experience! Deckbuilding meets tile placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a deck of supporters to fund your electoral campaign and defeat the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impersonate one of many runner-up Mayors, each with their unique supporters and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic placement on grid to trigger insane combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards and difficulties as you progress through each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the collection of 400+ cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature meets society in this cute but gory setting!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436970?t=1771863644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436970?t=1771863644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/3438dc18b0c217072b185d5c4573920c34b97aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771863644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/3438dc18b0c217072b185d5c4573920c34b97aa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771863644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2872680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every. Single. Species.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some help each other. Others give in to their natural instincts. <br>With more than 400 cards to discover, experiment with countless combinations and shape your own path!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/8ecc5b1414e316e0202176138bf5145f.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ecosystem Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards interact with each other on an expanding hexagonal grid. <br>Each card has a unique effect that influences the animals and plants around it on the board. <br>Inspired by nature, the possibilities are endless. Unleash your creativity and trigger insane combos in a single turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/c8eb4d587f2a62520d8ffc617e8b7f40.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule Wild City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your campaign, rally supporters, and outvote your rivals to become the Mayor of Wild City. <br>As you progress through your electoral campaign, you will face Protests and Boss Fights that shake up the rules, forcing you to quickly adapt to new obstacles and debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/943d746b21f78580f4e03e89a5c290e3.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploit and Escalate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more synergies you'll discover.<br>Thanks to a keyword-based system, a single card can be used in many different ways as each building block interconnects.<br>As every piece of your build comes together, you will reach heights you did not think were possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.poster.avif?t=1771863644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.webm?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3d24789d9dbf03d474036315abcf51b0.mp4?t=1771863644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique strategic roguelike deckbuilding experience! Deckbuilding meets tile placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a deck of supporters to fund your electoral campaign and defeat the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impersonate one of many runner-up Mayors, each with their unique supporters and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic placement on grid to trigger insane combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards and difficulties as you progress through each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the collection of 400+ cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature meets society in this cute but gory setting!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Monka Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/99fccfb228cf1e178d09c0a426ad930d8cfd275a/header.jpg?t=1771863644","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 - Developed by Monka Studios. Published by Catoptric Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2436970/1615727508/418ff67fe43fea39881af547904797516f3ce629/1771835859/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771850671","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2436970/1615727508/418ff67fe43fea39881af547904797516f3ce629/1771835859/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771850671","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2436970/1615727508/418ff67fe43fea39881af547904797516f3ce629/1771835859/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771850671","id":257292630,"name":"Wild City - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292630/683a7687f2f9d576c2cea46025386d6b5681b56a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771850671"}],"name":"Wild City","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong